+#### [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
+> **Description:** Flowise positions itself as "Build AI Agents, Visually" and focuses on low-code orchestration for chatflows, agent workflows, RAG pipelines, and self-hosted deployment. The README emphasizes quick local startup, Docker support, and broad integrations, which makes it a practical choice for ecommerce teams that want to prototype shopping assistants, returns helpers, or merchant-facing copilots quickly. GitHub showed 47,770 stars, TypeScript as the primary language, Apache License 2.0 in the repository license section, and recent activity with an update on 2025-12-29.
