+
+> This curated list of the best AI tools for ecommerce 2026 focuses on open source projects that you can inspect, self-host, extend, and integrate into real storefront operations. Instead of proprietary SaaS products, every entry here points to a public GitHub repository that can support catalog enrichment, AI search, support automation, recommendation systems, content generation, and ecommerce orchestration.
