+#### [Meilisearch](https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch)
+> **Description:** Meilisearch is a lightning-fast search engine API with hybrid search, search-as-you-type, semantic capabilities, filters, and faceting. Its README explicitly includes an ecommerce example and emphasizes relevant, low-latency search experiences, which is why it is one of the most practical open source options for product discovery. The community edition is MIT-licensed, while enterprise files are also present in the repository, so teams should pay attention to edition boundaries. GitHub showed 55,370 stars, Rust as the primary language, community edition MIT licensing, and a repo update on 2026-01-14.
