+## TL;DR
+- `Langflow`, `Flowise`, and `n8n` are the fastest ways to ship AI-powered ecommerce workflows without starting from a blank repo.
+- `Meilisearch`, `Typesense`, `Qdrant`, and `Weaviate` are strong foundations for semantic search, hybrid retrieval, and personalization.
