+## Why This List
+Open source matters in ecommerce because margins, data ownership, and integration flexibility matter. The best AI tools for ecommerce 2026 are often not ecommerce-only products; they are composable open source building blocks for search, chat, recommendations, content generation, and workflow automation that can be adapted to storefront, operations, and retention use cases.
