+# Contributing
+
+Thanks for contributing to `awesome-best-ai-tools-for-ecommerce-2026`.
+
+## Submission Rules
+
+- Every submission must be a public repository on `github.com`.
+- No proprietary SaaS tools, cloud-only products, or closed-source vendors.
+- The project must be relevant to ecommerce workflows such as search, support, recommendations, automation, content, analytics, or storefront operations.
+- Include the repository URL, stars, primary language, license, and latest commit date.
+- Base the description on the project's GitHub README or repository page.
+- If licensing is mixed, source-available, or non-OSI, say that explicitly.
+
