+- `Meilisearch`, `Typesense`, `Qdrant`, and `Weaviate` are strong foundations for semantic search, hybrid retrieval, and personalization.
+- `Chatwoot`, `Rasa`, `AnythingLLM`, and `MaxKB` fit customer support, sales assist, and internal knowledge use cases.
